WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.959
Navigating this ethical framework is a mandatory
operational requirement for the survival and legitimacy

2
00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:09.020
of modern biological science.

3
00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:15.099
The gatekeepers enforcing these regulations are
the Institutional Animal Care and Use Committees,

4
00:00:15.699 --> 00:00:16.699
or IACUC.

5
00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:20.339
Committee members themselves require
continuous education.

6
00:00:21.319 --> 00:00:24.860
New members must master the structural
foundations of review, while

7
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:29.959
experienced evaluators require constant updates
on the latest developments in research ethics.

8
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.879
On the other side of the protocol are the
researchers.

9
00:00:33.739 --> 00:00:38.440
This group spans from early-career postgraduate
and PhD candidates learning the basics,

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.339
to senior principal investigators managing
large-scale laboratories.

11
00:00:43.059 --> 00:00:47.360
For mid-career and senior researchers,
compliance becomes highly complex

12
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:53.419
when integrating animal models with advanced interdisciplinary
fields like artificial intelligence and large-scale

13
00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:54.419
data management.

14
00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:54.815
All of these stakeholders must operate
from a shared pedagogical baseline.
